GAL16V8
ADSCSIU3

ZREAD ZA1  ZA2  ZA3  ZA4  GAME ZA6  ZA15 MATCH GND
ZAS  ROMOE SEL  U2OE SLAVE U2CK ZUDS BUSRST STATOE VCC

/ROMOE.T = ZREAD * /ZA15 * U2OE * /SLAVE
    + ZREAD * GAME * ZA15 * /SLAVE
ROMOE.E = VCC

/SEL.T = /ZA6 * /ZA15 * /U2OE * /SLAVE
SEL.E = VCC

U2OE.T = U2OE * /SLAVE
    + /U2CK
U2OE.E = VCC

/SLAVE.T = /MATCH * /ZAS * BUSRST
SLAVE.E = VCC

U2CK.T = /ZREAD * /ZA1 * /ZA2 * ZA3 * /ZA4 * ZA6 * /SLAVE * /ZUDS * BUSRST
    + U2CK * BUSRST
U2CK.E = VCC

/STATOE.T = ZREAD * /ZA15 * SEL * /U2OE * /SLAVE
STATOE.E = VCC

ZUDS.T = GND
ZUDS.E = GND

BUSRST.T = GND
BUSRST.E = GND

DESCRIPTION

AdSCSI 2000 U3, equivalent equations fitted from the original chip's recorded behaviour (gals/u3). Pin names are the board nets measured on 2026-11-08 (schematic/netlist/gal_nets.csv).
